  "notes": "Input sockets are XLR/6.35 mm combo jacks (mic, line or instrument via the LINE/INST switch where present). INSERT jacks are TRS send/return; the signal path through them is not modelled. Playback outputs are RCA. MIDI IN/OUT are 5-pin DIN. USB bus-powered. Routing: the MIX knob blends inputs with playback 1-2 on MAIN OUT; MONITOR A/B selects playback 1-2 or 3-4 for the headphones.",
